  1281  /** @brief Duplicates a matvar_t structure
  1282   *
  1283   * Provides a clean function for duplicating a matvar_t structure.
  1284   * @ingroup MAT
  1285   * @param in pointer to the matvar_t structure to be duplicated
  1286   * @param opt 0 does a shallow duplicate and only assigns the data pointer to
  1287   *            the duplicated array.  1 will do a deep duplicate and actually
  1288   *            duplicate the contents of the data.  Warning: If you do a shallow
  1289   *            copy and free both structures, the data will be freed twice and
  1290   *            memory will be corrupted.  This may be fixed in a later release.
  1291   * @returns Pointer to the duplicated matvar_t structure.
